    "body": "My apologies. It seems I got very tired reading through different specs and I got confused.\n\nI retract most of my statements but one: the common section for placeholder mentions no exception for textareas and that's the section that's much easier to find right away, including navigating to [`developers.what.org`](https://developers.whatwg.org/), and typing in `placeholder` in the search box in the top right. Perhaps a short note about the exception is in order.\n\nThe scope of this issue is now considerably smaller than I first thought, so feel free to close with no further comment.\n\n(It seems this is the place that I started with and where I assumed that WHATWG spec also forbids this. Later I got confused between different sections of the spec and looked at the general section, while providing correct links in the issue. Sorry.)\n",
