    "created_at": "2015-08-28T15:36:45Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-08-28T15:36:45Z",
    "body": "You're right, I should stop looking at the spec as an HTML author, it's for browsers and implementation details instead of semantic abstractions are meaningful here. Then perhaps it's only the `developers.whatwg.org` that's misleading, as that is directly targeted at HTML authors.\n",
